<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '24px 64px 0' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 96, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'flex-start' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423' }}>
  之 BA：<span style={{ color: '#FA4F24' }}>岗位划分</span>，Agent 落在组织图的哪一格
     </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#8A8F99', marginTop: 8 }}>
   Agent 架构师最常犯的错，是先想「Agent 要做什么」，而不是先想「人原来做什么」
        </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E8E8E8' }} />

    <Box style={{ paddingTop: 16, paddingBottom: 8, height: 479, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12 }}>
        {/* 左：职责三分法 */}
   <Box style={{ width: 356, background: '#F7F7F8', borderRadius: 4, padding: '12px 14px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423' }}>一岗三分的职责切分</Text>
     <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#8A8F99', marginTop: 2, marginBottom: 8 }}>任何岗位引入 Agent 前都必须先做这一次切分</Text>
   {[
   { t: 'Agent 做', d: '高频、判断规则明确、出错可回滚', pct: '建议占比 60~70%', c: '#FA4F24', bg: '#FFF3EE' },
      { t: 'Agent 建议、人做', d: '规则存在但例外多、需要担责', pct: '建议占比 20~30%', c: '#F87D2F', bg: '#FFF8F2' },
     { t: '人做、Agent 辅助', d: '价值判断、跨组织协同、不可逆', pct: '必须保留', c: '#0F1423', bg: '#FFFFFF' },
   ].map((it, i) => (
       <Box key={it.t} style={{ flex: 1, background: it.bg, borderRadius: 3, padding: '8px 12px', marginBottom: i === 2 ? 0 : 7, borderLeft: '4px solid ' + it.c }}>
     <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: it.c, flex: 1 }}>{it.t}</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#8A8F99' }}>{it.pct}</Text>
   </Box>
     <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#5A6072', marginTop: 3, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>{it.d}</Text>
    </Box>
       ))}
   <Box style={{ height: 52, background: '#0F1423', borderRadius: 3, padding: '0 12px', justifyContent: 'center', marginTop: 8 }}>
     <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.9)', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
 切口选错：把「需要担责的判断」交给 Agent，是企业级 Agent 事故的头号来源。
    </Text>
      </Box>
      </Box>

     {/* 右：人类保留清单 */}
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
   <Box style={{ height: 178, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E8E8E8', borderRadius: 4, padding: '10px 14px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423', marginBottom: 6 }}>五类决定必须留在人手里</Text>
        {[
              '决定对人的处置：绩效、解聘、薪酬调整',
    '决定资金与承诺：付款、报价、对外签署',
   '决定合规与法律立场：定性、处罚、免责',
     '决定不可逆操作：删除、停产、撤品种',
 '决定冲突与例外：跨部门争议、合同例外',
       ].map((t, i) => (
     <Box key={t} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, flex: 1 }}>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FA4F24' }}>{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#3A4050' }}>{t}</Text>
      </Box>
          ))}
    </Box>

     <Box style={{ height: 168, background: '#F7F7F8', borderRadius: 4, padding: '10px 14px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423', marginBottom: 6 }}>岗位说明书的六个必填栏</Text>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', flexWrap: 'wrap', gap: 6 }}>
    {[
  { k: '岗位原名', v: '替代谁' },
     { k: '职责范围', v: '哪部分' },
          { k: '职权清单', v: '读 / 改 / 决' },
          { k: '升级路径', v: '何时给人' },
  { k: '验收口径', v: '怎么算做对' },
    { k: '失败处置', v: '错了怎么办' },
       ].map((it, i) => (
 <Box key={it.k} style={{ width: 236, height: 46, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 3, borderLeft: '3px solid #FA4F24', padding: '6px 10px', marginBottom: 6 }}>
   <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423' }}>{it.k}</Text>
     <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#8A8F99', marginTop: 2 }}>{it.v}必须可验证，不能写「视情况」</Text>
            </Box>
      ))}
            </Box>
            </Box>

  <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFF3EE', borderRadius: 4, borderLeft: '4px solid #FBA15C', padding: '0 14px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
       <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C43A17', width: 128 }}>组织侧的配套动作</Text>
   <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#5A6072', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
    设Agent 责任人（对 Agent 的输出负责，不对代码负责）、建代理授权矩阵、把「Agent 建议采纳率」纳入团队指标。只有这三件事到位，Agent 才不会变成没人负责的灰色地带。
   </Text>
            </Box>
   </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 58, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E8E8E8' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 10, height: 10, background: '#FA4F24' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A8F99', marginLeft: 12 }}>硕磐机密 · Agent智能体咨询方法论</Text>
   <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A8F99', marginLeft: 'auto' }}>19 / 30</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
